Place, period and map data shipped in the repository and the bundle
--------------------------------------------------------------------

- db/places/01-natural-earth.json, 02-natural-earth-physical.json, 04-natural-earth-places.json:
  Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com) — public domain.
- db/places/03-pleiades.json: Pleiades (https://pleiades.stoa.org) — CC BY 3.0; every row carries
  its attribution and Pleiades URI.
- db/places/05-curated.json and db/places/supplement: coordinates from Wikidata — CC0 1.0.
- db/places/polities: 21 outlines from OpenHistoricalMap — © OpenHistoricalMap contributors, Open
  Database License (ODbL 1.0); the other outlines and macro_regions.geojson — CC0 1.0. Each feature
  carries its own licence and source (db/places/polities/README.md).
- db/periods/periodo-seed.json: a subset of PeriodO (https://perio.do) — CC0 1.0.
- db/gazetteer: pins only (extracts.json). The GeoNames (CC BY 4.0), Wikidata (CC0) and Getty TGN
  (ODC Attribution License) extracts are downloaded by the user and are not in the repository or
  the bundle.
- Base map styles (web/styles/*.json) draw tiles the user downloads with `histmersion basemap fetch`
  or that are fetched online; their licences and credits are in
  docs/user-guide/how-to/open-data.md and docs/user-guide/how-to/base-maps.md.

