Programs the bundle runs beside the server
------------------------------------------

These are separate programs the server talks to over a socket or HTTP; each is distributed under
its own licence (THIRD-PARTY.md lists them with their libraries).

- PostgreSQL — PostgreSQL License; PostGIS — GPL-2.0-or-later; from conda-forge
  (runtime/postgres/pixi.lock).
- The converter (converter/), a Python service over PyMuPDF and pymupdf4llm (AGPL-3.0, dual
  licensed by Artifex), docling (MIT), PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause) and their dependencies
  (converter/uv.lock).
- The native binaries are built with GraalVM Community Edition, whose runtime parts compiled into
  them are GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception.
